MODULE COUNTER

IMPORT MUX
IMPORT MUX16
IMPORT 16BITADDER
IMPORT REGISTER

INPUT IN[16]
INPUT LOAD
INPUT RESET
INPUT INC

CLOCK CLK

OUTPUT OUT[16]

WIRE TEMP1[16]
WIRE TEMP2[16]
WIRE TEMP3[16]
WIRE TEMP4[16]
WIRE ONE16[16]
WIRE INC16[16]
WIRE LOAD16[16]

HIGH ONE
LOW ZERO

JOIN LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD LOAD16

MUX16 M1 TEMP1 IN LOAD16 TEMP2
REGISTER R1 TEMP2 ONE RESET CLK TEMP3

JOIN ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ONE ONE16

JOIN INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC INC16

16BITADDER A1 TEMP3 ONE16 TEMP4
MUX16 M2 TEMP3 TEMP4 INC16 TEMP1

BUF BU1 TEMP3 OUT
